<title>INDIA: Michael Jackson cuts out one show in India.</title>
<headline>Michael Jackson cuts out one show in India.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. pop star Michael Jackson will stage just one concert in Bombay instead of the two originally planned, a public relations spokeswoman said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Jackson will appear in Bombay on November 1 for the Indian leg of his tour through 11 East European and Asian countries.</p>
<p>&quot;For the moment they are only going to have one show,&quot; a spokeswoman for Clea Public Relations said.</p>
<p>She gave no reason for the change.</p>
</text>
